<title>USA: Valero to buy Salomon's Basis unit.</title>
<headline>Valero to buy Salomon's Basis unit.</headline>
<dateline>SAN ANTONIO 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Valero Energy Corp signed a letter of intent to acquire Salomon Inc's Basis Petroleum Inc unit for about $485 million, the companies said.</p>
<p>Valero will acquire the stock of Basis for $285 million, plus approximately $200 million for inventories and other working capital to be acquired in the transaction.</p>
<p>The purchase price will consist of Valero common stock having a fair market value of approximately $120 million, with the remainder to be paid in cash.</p>
</text>
